      "statement": "Provider prompt or context caching differs materially across the dated notes: Claude documents prefix caching with 5-minute default and optional 1-hour TTLs, Gemini documents opportunistic implicit caching plus named explicit caches, and GPT documents implicit or explicit breakpoints with at-least-30-minute cache eligibility.",
