      "statement": "The cited provider notes describe different long-context pricing thresholds and scopes: Claude's cited 1M-context models use listed rates throughout, Gemini's cited Pro preview has full-request tiers up to and over 200K input tokens, and the cited GPT model applies long-context rates to the entire request above 272,000 input tokens.",
