    {
      "id": "claim_d10b24c9ca1e40158355ad86da3fbad1",
      "statement": "Benchmark choice should follow capability: the dated map pairs repository software engineering with SWE-Bench Pro, function calling with BFCL, multi-step tools with τ²-bench, long-context work with AA Long Context Reasoning, conversational quality with Arena, and cost efficiency with cost per successful task.",
